.TH "GINOT-MCP-SERVER" "1" "" "Ginot HaIr" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
\&ginot\-mcp\-server \- Serve read\-only public planning data over MCP stdio.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\&PYTHONPATH=src python3 \-m ginot.mcp_server [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\&Reads the public dataset and exchanges JSON\-RPC messages over stdin/stdout. No network requests, writes or private planner files. Objection dates are derived, not verified official deadlines. Run from the repository root.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\&\-h, \-\-help
\&Show command help and exit without performing work.
.TP
\&\-\-data VALUE
\&Public dataset to serve. Default: docs/data.json.
.SH EXIT STATUS
\&0 on success or \-\-help. Invalid arguments return 2. Runtime failures return nonzero.
.SH NOTES
\&These manuals document existing Python entrypoints, not installed executable aliases. Internal CI, maintenance and developer scripts are not part of this manual package.
